# G11 world-space UI in the editor (just qa-editor Tests/QA/world-ui.qa): the Demo's World UI scene with a walker's
# nameplate marker selected (its map-pin badge at WorldOffset, the dashed line to the walker, the inspector), the
# Label3D signs drawn in the scene view; then the menu sign picked by clicking its text.
wait-for project 300
open Examples/Demo/Assets/Scenes/world_ui.mfscene
wait-for project 300
wait 30
select Walkers/Nell/Nameplate
camera -4 1.8 -1 13 -12 -14
wait 30
capture world-ui-marker
select MenuSign
wait 20
capture world-ui-label
